It’s something which only teachers with superpowers can do 
He gets very angry when we score low sometimes but i guess that is needed for us to push ourselves'),
(1001307,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th ICSE','teacher','Jitesh Sir','Physics',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Anteresting personality , he pretends that he doesn’t know anything but at the end we all know his knowledge of the subjects extend far beyond textbooks that is already seen his classes 
