(1000889,2025,'Chembur Naka','12th Science GRIT','teacher','Abhijit Sir','Physics',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'A very punctual faculty mayank has.His knowledge for physics is just unbelievable.The way his way of teaching makes  very easier.The way he puts extra efforts for us is really appreciated.Im just so grateful to the universe to have him as my MENTOR!'),
