(1000889,2025,'Chembur Naka','12th Science GRIT','teacher','Sohail Sir','Chemistry',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Has very good knowledge about his subject.His notes are pretty good.Very punctual(example-if the lecture is at 2:30 at 2:29 he’s step the class)and his lectures are very much heavy so we’ve to ask him for a 10minutes break n he gives to be honest.'),
