(1001094,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Vishal Sir','Geometry',1.0,2.0,2.0,2.0,3.0,'OK-OK types,  we aren''t able to understand the concept at all . Sir only rums the portion he only wats to complete our portion at any cost.During our semester exams, there was a chapter named circle, which was a very big and important chapter. But just one day before our school exam, he explained the chapter very quickly, only from top to bottom, just for the sake of covering it. Because of this, we couldn’t understand the  properly. I feel he should teach such important chapters detail and with more time so that students can understand better. Also the chap trigonometry he literally finished 2 practice sets 1.5 hours!'),
