(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Vikas Sir','English',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Very excellent sir he is he explains the chapter a way that even goes above the textbook if any word the chapter we are not able to understand he helps making us understand the meaning due to him my writing skills as well as grammar hascreased i am greatful to have him as my mentor'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Lata Mam','Hindi',5.0,4.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Excellent teacher during hindi any chapter or grammar written shudh hindi which we don''t understand she makes it easier for us she is very supportive'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Mahesh Sir','Algebra',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Best sir of all time no one explains as algebra as well as he is the way he maintains decorum and discipline class is no way I have imagined he makes algebra more easier and I am greatful to have him as my algebra professor i am also greatful to have him as my mentor'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Vishal Sir','Geometry',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'The best sir of geometry he makes geometry easier to us as writing pencil on paper even other subjects such as algebra or science 2 he makes it easier for us I am very greatful to have him as a great mentor'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Subhankar Sir','Science 1',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'Subhankar sir combines science like Newton and Einstein together he explains science 1 as far better as any otherstitute and school he is also supportive towards doubt solving lectures and makes us learn things outside of the textbook I am grateful to have him as my mentor'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Abhishek Sir','History',5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'He is an excellent professor for history and teaches us things we might not know or outside of the textbook he teaches history is as if we are the past and watching the events no one explains history is better as him i am greatful to have him as my mentor'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Ritika Mam','Geography',5.0,NULL,4.0,5.0,5.0,'She is excellent geography she even makes us laugh class and makes us understand geography a way that leaves the school behind every chapter is easy when studying because of her'),
(1001113,2025,'Chembur Naka','10th SSC','teacher','Bharti Mam','Marathi',4.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,'She is an excellent teacher and makes marathi words easier to me i am also trying to speak marathi because of her she makes marathi very easy i wish she explains marathi chapters a little bit hindi so it helps us students who don''t understand marathi an efficient way'),
